---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import OdysseyCognition from '../../../components/blog/OdysseyCognition.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="MetaMind Dossier — From Reasoning Model to Cognitive AI"
  description="The NeurIPS 2025 Spotlight technical contribution behind MetaMind, and the cognitive research frontier it opens."
  image="/assets/meta/og-metamind-cognitive-odyssey.png"
  imageAlt="Odysseus navigating branching cognitive choices toward Ithaca"
  type="article"
  active="notes"
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <p class="index-label">Dossier 01 / MetaMind</p>
      <h1>From Reasoning Model<br />to Cognitive AI.</h1>
      <p>One research program, read at two levels: the verified technical contribution that makes social thought explicit, and the cognitive frontier that extends beyond the paper.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="dossier">
      <div class="dossier-visual dossier-visual--odyssey" data-reveal>
        <figure><OdysseyCognition /></figure>
        <div class="dossier-thesis">
          <span>MetaMind / system thesis</span>
          <strong>Keep ambiguity visible until evidence can change it.</strong>
          <small>Hypothesize · Constrain · Validate · Remember</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="dossier-essays" data-reveal>
        <article><figure class="essay-card-art"><img src="/assets/images/metamind-technical-instrument-v2.webp" width="1920" height="1080" alt="A three-stage computational instrument connected by a persistent memory loop" loading="lazy" /></figure><p class="index-label">01 / Technical contribution</p><h2>Social intelligence begins before the answer.</h2><p>How MetaMind turns latent mental states, social constraints, validation, and memory into an explicit computational system — evaluated across 16+ models, with 14 paired backbone comparisons.</p><a class="action action-dark" href="/blog/MetaMind/technical-contribution/">Read the technical account →</a></article>
        <article><figure class="essay-card-art"><img src="/assets/images/odyssey-cognition-hero.webp" width="1920" height="1080" alt="Odysseus navigating branching choices toward Ithaca" loading="lazy" /></figure><p class="index-label">02 / Cognitive frontier</p><h2>From cognitive scaffolds to evolvable capability.</h2><p>A research agenda for cognitive architecture, process learning, self-evolution, cognitive world models, and super-world games.</p><a class="action action-dark" href="/blog/MetaMind/cognitive-frontier/">Explore the cognitive frontier →</a></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <SiteFooter />
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
